{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"key"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SD3Keyxmfp","text":"Key"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"default"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"defaultValue"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@autoclosure"},{"kind":"text","text":" () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SD5Valueq_mfp","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SD5Valueq_mfp","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"set"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key the look up in the dictionary."}]}],"name":"key"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default value to use if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key"},{"text":" doesn’t exist in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"dictionary."}]}],"name":"defaultValue"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The value associated with "},{"code":"key","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the dictionary; otherwise,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"defaultValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this subscript when you want either the value for a particular key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or, when that key is not present in the dictionary, a default value. This","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example uses the subscript with a message to use in case an HTTP response","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"code isn’t recognized:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var responseMessages = [200: \"OK\",","                        403: \"Access forbidden\",","                        404: \"File not found\",","                        500: \"Internal server error\"]","","let httpResponseCodes = [200, 403, 301]","for code in httpResponseCodes {","    let message = responseMessages[code, default: \"Unknown response\"]","    print(\"Response \\(code): \\(message)\")","}","\/\/ Prints \"Response 200: OK\"","\/\/ Prints \"Response 403: Access forbidden\"","\/\/ Prints \"Response 301: Unknown response\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When a dictionary’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" type has value semantics, you can use this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"subscript to perform in-place operations on values in the dictionary.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The following example uses this subscript while counting the occurrences","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of each letter in a string:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let message = \"Hello, Elle!\"","var letterCounts: [Character: Int] = [:]","for letter in message {","    letterCounts[letter, default: 0] += 1","}","\/\/ letterCounts == [\"H\": 1, \"e\": 2, \"l\": 4, \"o\": 1, ...]"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":"letterCounts[letter, default: 0] += 1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is executed with a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value of ","type":"text"},{"code":"letter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that isn’t already a key in ","type":"text"},{"code":"letterCounts","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specified default value (","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") is returned from the subscript,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"incremented, and then added to the dictionary under that key.","type":"text"}]},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not use this subscript to modify dictionary values if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dictionary’s "},{"code":"Value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" type is a class. In that case, the default value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and key are not written back to the dictionary after an operation."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/subscript(_:default:)"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Accessing Keys and Values","anchor":"Accessing-Keys-and-Values","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/subscript(_:)-8rfql","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/index(forKey:)","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/subscript(_:)-4bhoo","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/keys-swift.property","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/values-swift.property","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/first","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/randomElement()","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/randomElement(using:)","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/init(dictionaryLiteral:)","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Dictionary\/indices"],"generated":true}],"abstract":[{"text":"Accesses the value